t-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Staggering_Smite_(Condition)\" title=\"Staggering Smite (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8a/Staggering_Smite_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Staggering_Smite_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8a/Staggering_Smite_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Staggering_Smite_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8a/Staggering_Smite_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Staggering_Smite_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Staggering Smite\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8a/Staggering_Smite_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Staggering_Smite_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8a/Staggering_Smite_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Staggering_Smite_(Condition)\" title=\"Staggering Smite (Condition)\">Staggering Smite</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: 1 turn</p><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"WIS Save (Spell save DC)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Wisdom\" title=\"Wisdom\">WIS</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_throws\" title=\"Saving throws\">Save</a> (<a href=\"/wiki/Dice_rolls#Spell_save_DC\" title=\"Dice rolls\">Spell save DC</a>)</p>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Has <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Disadvantage\" title=\"Disadvantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/27px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/41px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/55px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Disadvantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/27px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"27\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Disadvantage\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Disadvantage\">Disadvantage</a> on <a href=\"/wiki/Attack_Rolls\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack Rolls\">Attack Rolls</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Ability_Check\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ability Check\">Ability Checks</a>, and can't take reactions.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\nClasses: <ul><li> Class level 7: <a href=\"/wiki/The_Hexblade\" title=\"The Hexblade\">The Hexblade</a></li></ul>\n<p>Used by creatures:\n<a href=\"/wiki/That_Which_Lurks\" title=\"That Which Lurks\">That Which Lurks</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/That_Which_Guards\" title=\"That Which Guards\">That Which Guards</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/That_Which_Watches\" title=\"That Which Watches\">That Which Watches</a>, and <a href=\"/wiki/Stalker_Svignee\" title=\"Stalker Svignee\">Stalker Svignee</a>\n</p>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>This spell can only be learned by <a href=\"/wiki/Hexblade\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Hexblade\">Hexblade</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Warlocks\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Warlocks\">warlocks</a> despite being a <a href=\"/wiki/Paladin_spells\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Paladin spells\">paladin spell</a> in D&amp;D 5e, as <a href=\"/wiki/Paladin\" title=\"Paladin\">paladins</a> do not get access to level 4 spells until level 13 in D&amp;D 5e.</li>\n<li>See <a href=\"/wiki/Smite\" title=\"Smite\">Smite</a> for additional functionality information.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715035306\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.087 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.091 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3568/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 69297/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 24569/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 25/200\nExpensive parser function count: 3/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 4/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 35/1000\nLua time usage: 0.022/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1326008/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n118.30%   88.807     48 Template:Trim\n100.00%   75.068      1 Template:Feature_page\n100.00%   75.068      1 -total\n 26.83%   20.141      9 Template:Icon_text\n 21.19%   15.903      5 Template:Icon_link\n 18.32%   13.753      1 Template:Feature_page/technical_section\n 13.16%    9.881      9 Template:Ifempty\n 13.02%    9.773      1 Template:DamageType\n 12.29%    9.226      1 Templ